classes\ that\ are\ api\ main\ classes\ should\ be\ contract\ types,\ because\ API\ code\ holds\ interfaces,\ records,\ enums,\ exceptions,\ annotations\ and\ final\ constant\ holders\ (only\ static\ final\ fields\ and\ a\ private\ constructor),\ carries\ no\ CDI\ scope,\ and\ depends\ only\ on\ java,\ javax,\ jakarta,\ org.eclipse.microprofile,\ annotation\ types\ and\ API\ code.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest\ API\ types\ are\ values.\ Every\ field\ is\ final.\ A\ static\ field\ is\ refused\ when\ its\ declared\ type\ is\ an\ array,\ or\ when\ the\ static\ initializer\ constructs\ a\ mutable\ java.util\ collection\ or\ a\ java.util.concurrent\ type\ other\ than\ TimeUnit,\ or\ directly\ calls\ a\ constructor\ or\ method\ of\ the\ same\ class\ whose\ body,\ lambdas\ included,\ does.\ That\ is\ one\ call\ level,\ judged\ within\ the\ class,\ with\ no\ data\ flow.\ An\ interface's\ static\ methods\ are\ factories\ that\ return\ the\ interface\ or\ a\ permitted\ subtype.\ A\ type\ body\ may\ call\ a\ sealed\ API\ interface\ and\ any\ API\ interface\ it\ implements,\ and\ no\ other\ non-sealed\ API\ interface.\ Value\ code,\ the\ calls,\ constructor\ calls\ and\ field\ accesses\ in\ method\ and\ constructor\ bodies\ and\ static\ initializers,\ may\ use\ the\ API\ allowlist\ except\ the\ packages\ java.io,\ java.nio,\ java.net,\ java.sql,\ javax.sql,\ javax.naming,\ java.lang.reflect,\ java.lang.invoke,\ java.util.concurrent,\ java.util.logging,\ java.util.regex,\ jakarta.ws.rs.client\ and\ org.eclipse.microprofile.rest.client\ and\ everything\ under\ them,\ the\ classes\ java.lang.System,\ Runtime,\ Thread,\ ProcessBuilder,\ ClassLoader\ and\ java.util.ServiceLoader,\ and\ the\ reflective\ members\ of\ java.lang.Class\ (forName,\ newInstance,\ getClassLoader,\ getResource\ and\ the\ get\ Method,\ Field\ and\ Constructor\ families).\ java.net.URI,\ java.nio.charset.Charset,\ java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets\ and\ java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit\ are\ allowed.\ Compiler-generated\ synthetic\ and\ bridge\ members,\ and\ an\ enum's\ values()\ and\ valueOf(String),\ are\ not\ judged.\ A\ lambda\ is\ judged\ as\ the\ member\ that\ holds\ it.\ These\ checks\ skip\ a\ class\ that\ is\ a\ plain\ class.=a74be181-7c9b-4726-a6d5-dbe48ff53204
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ be\ implementation\ code\ when\ they\ implement\ an\ API\ interface,\ because\ a\ main\ class\ that\ implements\ an\ API\ interface\ is\ implementation\ code;\ a\ JAX-RS\ resource\ may\ implement\ its\ JAX-RS\ API\ interface,\ a\ generated\ MicroProfile\ REST\ client\ is\ exempt,\ and\ a\ record,\ enum,\ interface,\ exception\ or\ permitted\ subtype\ of\ a\ sealed\ API\ interface\ in\ API\ code\ may\ implement\ an\ API\ interface.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=d4818811-03b1-44d1-8145-46d2a628b338
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ be\ in\ a\ package\ that\ names\ a\ role,\ because\ a\ main\ class\ under\ io.freedriver\ is\ in\ a\ package\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ or\ below\ one;\ the\ utility\ artifactIds\ stereotypes,\ mcp-support,\ hit-window\ and\ freedriver-mqtt\ are\ exempt=ed82614d-b26d-49b1-ba39-f56a4c3fca61
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ keep\ implementation\ packages\ private,\ because\ an\ implementation\ is\ a\ package\ io.freedriver..impl.<name>\ and\ its\ subpackages;\ only\ its\ own\ classes\ depend\ on\ it,\ and\ it\ depends\ on\ no\ class\ in\ a\ package\ io.freedriver..service..\ and\ on\ no\ other\ implementation=96e20fd0-a930-4953-8042-f2d098629412
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ share\ their\ module's\ one\ role,\ because\ a\ module\ holds\ one\ role\:\ API,\ implementation,\ service\ or\ utility.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=12e43ba5-40c5-4f39-be5c-1c428f36d2e3
classes\ that\ are\ service\ main\ classes\ should\ depend\ only\ on\ the\ service\ allowlist,\ because\ service\ code\ depends\ only\ on\ java,\ javax,\ jakarta,\ io.quarkus\ except\ io.quarkus.mongodb.panache\ and\ io.quarkus.hibernate.orm.panache,\ io.smallrye,\ org.eclipse.microprofile,\ io.micrometer,\ annotation\ types,\ service\ code\ of\ its\ own\ module,\ API\ code\ and\ the\ utility\ artifactIds\ stereotypes,\ mcp-support,\ hit-window\ and\ freedriver-mqtt.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest.\ An\ HTTP\ edge\ class,\ one\ that\ observes\ io.quarkus.vertx.http.runtime.filters.Filters\ or\ io.vertx.ext.web.Router,\ has\ a\ method\ annotated\ @io.quarkus.vertx.web.Route\ or\ @io.quarkus.vertx.web.RouteFilter,\ or\ implements\ an\ io.quarkus.oidc\ interface,\ may\ also\ depend\ on\ io.vertx.core\ and\ io.vertx.ext.web.\ An\ MCP\ edge\ class,\ one\ with\ a\ method\ annotated\ from\ io.quarkiverse.mcp.server\ or\ that\ implements\ an\ interface\ from\ that\ package,\ may\ also\ depend\ on\ io.quarkiverse.mcp.server=8f218496-900c-4422-88af-f570fa14162c
